storage/disk43/seasons/086d070e-7891-43a7-903b-4e3b30992e5f.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk50/seasons/ee9cb53e-51e2-4c2a-b4c6-b0ff1124c0e3.jpeg","likes":21,"dislikes":1,"views":5000,"release_date":"1593561600000","season_number":1,"description":"Seo Gong Myung is the efficient and hard-nosed elite civil servant, who can multi-task with ease and is dubbed the ‘Number One Handsome Man’ on the District People's Committee. However, he is a cold, rigid, and independent person, who is deemed prickly and unapproachable at the best of times. Seo Gong Myung is guided by his moral convictions, which he staunchly adheres to, opting to do everything ‘by the book’.  His lack of flexibility and his penchant for criticizing all those who enter his domain, not only serve to earn him the nickname ‘Great Lucifer’, but more enemies than friends.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8.1}],"value":8.1,"age":"PG-13"},"current_season_id":2241,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}